def event_review_done_ticket_cost: "- Ticket \(.ticket // "unknown") reached its cost cap: its team stopped and will not reopen. Tell \($user) on the ticket under rule 4: work done (read its last report), what remains, spent amount and cap. Ask one closed question about raising this ticket’s cap, yes or no, with your recommendation and an amount. The user answers with a “Cap <amount>” line on the ticket, for example “Cap 60”; the team then reopens under the rules. Script output, quoted:\n    | \(.text | gsub("\n"; " "))";
